# Ash, Party Crasher ({R}{W}, 2/2 haste): "Celebration — Whenever Ash attacks, if two or more nonland permanents entered the battlefield
# under your control this turn, put a +1/+1 counter on Ash" (CR 207.2c, 603.4). On turn one a Mox Ruby and Ash are exactly two nonland
# permanents (the Plains is a land and does not count), so Ash grows as it attacks: 3 damage with the counter on it (17). On turn
